# Auto-deploy to Vercel

There is no `package.json`. After a successful turn that changed website files (`index.html`, other root HTML, `agilix-collective/**`, `.htaccess`, `vercel.json`):

1. Run production deploy before ending:
   ```bash
   npx --yes vercel --prod --yes
   ```
2. If deploy fails, report the error and point to `.cursor/deploy-log.txt`.
3. Do not skip deploy because Cursor hooks might also deploy — hooks are a backup; still run the command after site edits.
4. Skip deploy only when the turn made **no** website file changes (questions, planning-only, rules-only, etc.).
